{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01002",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.32,
      "end_seconds": 13.06,
      "duration_seconds": 12.74,
      "text": "Mr Nair, I have your GP's letter here, it mentions you've been unwell on and off since the summer. Where would you like to begin? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.8,
      "end_seconds": 24.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "Yes, yes, doctor. It is nothing very much, only that I am a bit shaky, you know, in the mornings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.21,
      "end_seconds": 31.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "A bit shaky in the mornings. Which part of you shakes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.76,
      "end_seconds": 41.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "The hands. Mostly when I hold the tea cup, a little spilling. It settles by afternoon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.74,
      "end_seconds": 46.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "And at night, how are you sleeping?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.61,
      "end_seconds": 55.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Not well. I wake at three, four o'clock, and then no sleep."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.09,
      "end_seconds": 60.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "What's your stomach like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.23,
      "end_seconds": 68.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Upset. Sometimes burning, sometimes nausea, in the morning also."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.38,
      "end_seconds": 71.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "And your mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.37,
      "end_seconds": 76.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Low, a little. Work is stressful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.8,
      "end_seconds": 82.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "How about your memory and concentration?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.13,
      "end_seconds": 93.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "Forgetting small things. Where I kept the car keys. My wife says it is old age, but I am forty-five."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.18,
      "end_seconds": 106.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "You mentioned the tea cup. Could you tell me how much alcohol you drink, in a usual week?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.68,
      "end_seconds": 116.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "Oh, very little. A few drinks, with friends. Two, three beers after work, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.5,
      "end_seconds": 123.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Two or three beers after work, how many days is that? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.06,
      "end_seconds": 133.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "Some days. Maybe four or five. And at the weekends, a little more. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.52,
      "end_seconds": 141.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "A little more, can you put a number on it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.05,
      "end_seconds": 148.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Perhaps eight, ten. But it's beer, not whisky. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.9,
      "end_seconds": 162.65,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "Thank you, I'll write that down as you've said it. Any blackouts, where you can't remember a night?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.43,
      "end_seconds": 166.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "No, no blackouts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.06,
      "end_seconds": 170.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any fits?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.09,
      "end_seconds": 173.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No fits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.33,
      "end_seconds": 177.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you vomited any blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.89,
      "end_seconds": 180.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.55,
      "end_seconds": 184.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Any black stools?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.92,
      "end_seconds": 189.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "No, they are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.54,
      "end_seconds": 195.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Have you had thoughts of harming yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.88,
      "end_seconds": 200.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No, never. I am a family man."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.57,
      "end_seconds": 206.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "What medicines do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.68,
      "end_seconds": 213.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "One tablet for the acidity, omeprazole, 20 mg, in the morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.96,
      "end_seconds": 217.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.0,
      "end_seconds": 228.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Perhaps. At the dentist, something made me swell up, but I don't know what it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.31,
      "end_seconds": 234.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "I'll note it as possible. Any operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.27,
      "end_seconds": 239.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Appendix, in 2005."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.64,
      "end_seconds": 245.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Liver trouble in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.26,
      "end_seconds": 253.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "My father had liver problems. He passed at sixty-two."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.17,
      "end_seconds": 271.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Let me look at your hands. Hold them out in front of you, fingers spread."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.04,
      "end_seconds": 276.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Like this? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.11,
      "end_seconds": 283.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "I can see a fine tremor in both hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.66,
      "end_seconds": 288.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "It is the tea, I think. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.0,
      "end_seconds": 304.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Now I'm going to press on your tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.29,
      "end_seconds": 313.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Ah, yes, there it is tender a little. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.76,
      "end_seconds": 321.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "The abdomen is soft, with mild tenderness under the right ribs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.18,
      "end_seconds": 326.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Is it serious? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.95,
      "end_seconds": 331.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Any palpitations, any racing of the heart?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.05,
      "end_seconds": 337.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.16,
      "end_seconds": 341.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Any cough or trouble with breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.26,
      "end_seconds": 348.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "No, nothing, I am fine there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.14,
      "end_seconds": 363.95,
      "duration_seconds": 14.81,
      "text": "I'd like to look into the shakiness, the stomach and the sleep together. I'd like to arrange liver blood tests, a full blood count, and an ultrasound scan of the liver."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.27,
      "end_seconds": 370.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Is it about the beer? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.02,
      "end_seconds": 384.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.76,
      "text": "I'm not going to jump to conclusions. These tests help us see what's happening inside, and then we'll talk. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.48,
      "end_seconds": 389.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Okay, doctor. I will do it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.37,
      "end_seconds": 410.21,
      "duration_seconds": 17.84,
      "text": "Let me repeat back what you've told me. Shaky hands in the mornings, poor sleep, an upset stomach, low mood, forgetting things, and about eight to ten beers at the weekend plus most weeknights. Is that fair? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 412.84,
      "end_seconds": 416.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Yes. That is fair. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.87,
      "end_seconds": 422.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks with the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.59,
      "end_seconds": 429.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Two weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
    }
  ]
}
